From a683d5d0d7aa661068b13e8bf996cd86c9bd798b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:34:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Mustafar landing stage: structure fix 02 data (A3d)

Three open hangar bays with sloped partitions, the entrance rebuilt as a
facility wing with a wider outer frame and a 2.0 m door, and banded low
structures. Collision ray raised to 1.4 m so the passage side walls stay
blocked; door walkable width 1.88 m.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
